      "releaseNotes": "Ready for launch day.\n\n   • Music keeps playing when you leave the app, and on AirPods and other Bluetooth headphones.\n   • Expand the turntable, turn your iPhone on its side, and the water turns with it.\n   • Tap the water to drop a ring, even while a record plays.\n   • Album covers in Search, and clearer menus.\n   • Better with VoiceOver, plus a few minor fixes.",
